OL,5,G0600 Teleshopping
OL,6,G0900 Four in a Bed
OL,7,     FIn the Scottish Highlands, things
OL,8,     Fget off on the wrong foot at
OL,9,     FStephen and Margaret's Clachan
OL,10,     FGarden B&B thanks to an unpopular
OL,11,     Fshoes-off policy.
OL,12,G0930 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FGraham hosts the week's second
OL,14,     Fvisit at his Highland Premier
OL,15,     FGlamping Pods glampsite near
OL,16,     FInverness, where he hopes to
OL,17,     Finspire a spirit of adventure with
OL,18,     Fa search for the Loch Ness
OL,19,     FMonster.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/12
