OL,5,G1100 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FIt's been a topsy-turvy week with
OL,7,     Fsome B&Bers delighted with their
OL,8,     Fscores - and others not so much.
OL,9,     FAfter a little bit of a praise and
OL,10,     Fa lot of moaning, who'll win?
OL,11,G1130 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FNa'im and Sara host first at their
OL,13,     Fhotel in the breathtaking Cumbrian
OL,14,     Fcountryside. But one pair are too
OL,15,     Fpreoccupied with the furniture to
OL,16,     Fcare about the view.
OL,17,G1200 Four in a Bed
OL,18,     FNeil and Jack host at their hotel
OL,19,     Fnear majestic Windermere, where
OL,20,     Fthe B&Bers enjoy yet more stunning
OL,21,     Fviews. But there's still
OL,22,     Fnegativity in the feedback.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG3/12
