OL,5,G1330 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FOn payment day, the B&Bers clash
OL,7,     Fover furniture failings and clock
OL,8,     Fcomplaints. And sparks fly -
OL,9,     Fironically - over a lack of
OL,10,     Felectricity. But who's won?
OL,11,G1400 Worst House on the Street
OL,12,     FTo get onto the property ladder,
OL,13,     Fbest mates Brad and Billy have
OL,14,     Fbought a run-down house in
OL,15,     FCoventry together. Scarlette and
OL,16,     FStuart help them turn it into a
OL,17,     Fhome.
