OL,6,     FWhen it comes to dating etiquette,
OL,7,     FBreeze the American bulldog cross
OL,8,     Fleaves a lot to be desired as he
OL,9,     Fmeets 31-year-old Charlotte. Will
OL,10,     Fshe fall for him anyway?
OL,11,G1600 A Place in the Sun
OL,12,     FMoto GP fan Jackie and her
OL,13,     Fdaughter Tayla want a holiday home
OL,14,     Fin rural Valencia for #150k. Will
OL,15,     Fany of Jean Johansson's wow-factor
OL,16,     Fvillas or rustic retreats get
OL,17,     Ftheir hearts racing?
