OL,5,G1700 A Place in the Sun
OL,6,     FHelen and John look for a perfect
OL,7,     FSpanish holiday home in Almeria
OL,8,     Ffor #200k, from a place that
OL,9,     Fdivides them to a vivacious villa
OL,10,     Fthat has them singing in unison.
OL,11,     FWill they put in an offer?
OL,12,G1800 A Place in the Sun
OL,13,     FShukesi and Nitesh are ready to
OL,14,     Fmake waves in their retirement
OL,15,     Fwith a bolthole on Spain's Costa
OL,16,     Fdel Sol. Will a stylish corner
OL,17,     Fhouse or an apartment with
OL,18,     Fgorgeous views be the one for
OL,19,     Fthem?
